{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Dungeon Crawler Rogue-like with strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through a randomly generated labyrinth and encounter a variety of enemies and events. Build your party with different skills and equipments to defeat strong enemies and to conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labyrinth Trailblazer takes traditional Dungeon Crawler and streamlines it for a more roguelike approach making it easier to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person dungeon crawler</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/a279853bf734d9057df7bb14775cb2ed.poster.avif?t=1768965105\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/a279853bf734d9057df7bb14775cb2ed.webm?t=1768965105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based party combat: each character and enemy takes will take one turn at a time before they can act again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shows the outcome of your actions in complex scenarios.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/9aa4b4215f3da377171b31998a2fa4ff.poster.avif?t=1768965105\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/9aa4b4215f3da377171b31998a2fa4ff.webm?t=1768965105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v